      "2024-05    0.193    0.209    0.146    0.163     0.163     0.162  \n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "METRICS FRAMEWORK\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "M1 Retention:  % of activated users transacting in month 1\n",
      "M3 Retention:  % still active in month 3\n",
      "M6 Retention:  % still active in month 6\n",
      "12mo LTV:      Cumulative revenue per user over 12 months\n",
      "Premium conv:  % of free users upgrading within 90 days\n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "INSIGHT 1: Retention Step-Change After KYC Fix (Sep 2024)\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "Pre-fix cohorts (before 2024-09):\n",
      "  Average M1 retention: 51.8%\n",
      "  Number of cohorts: 8\n",
      "\n",
      "Post-fix cohorts (2024-09 onwards):\n",
      "  Average M1 retention: 63.6%\n",
      "  Number of cohorts: 4\n",
      "\n",
      "M1 Retention Lift: +11.8 percentage points\n",
      "✅ SIGNAL: KYC fix improved activation quality\n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "INSIGHT 2: Retention Plateau & Long-Term User Base\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "Pre-fix cohorts: Average M6 retention = 19.9%\n",
      "  → Natural \"loyal core\" segment is ~15–20% of activated users\n",
      "\n",
      "Post-fix cohorts: Average M6 retention = 32.1%\n",
      "  → Post-fix stabilises higher, indicating improved user quality\n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "INSIGHT 3 & 4: Retention by Channel & Subscription Plan\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "By Plan (M6 retention, from LTV curves below):\n",
      "  • Free (pre-fix):     ~21%   ⚠️  Low retention\n",
      "  • Premium (pre-fix):  ~55%   ✅ ~2.6× better retention\n",
      "\n",
      "📌 Strategic insight: Premium plan is the #1 retention lever\n",
      "   Plan-based retention gap exceeds channel differences.\n",
      "\n",
      "⚠️  Channel-level retention (referral/organic/paid social) is not\n",
      "   available in this dataset — the cohort matrix is plan-agnostic.\n",
      "   Channel analysis lives in Project 1 (funnel) and Project 4 (segmentation).\n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "LTV CALCULATION: 12-MONTH PROJECTION\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "FREE PLAN (ARPU €3.2/mo):\n",
      "  Pre-fix  (M6 ret 21%):  €12.03\n",
      "  Post-fix (M6 ret 31%):  €15.65\n",
      "  Improvement:                 +€3.62 (+30%)\n",
      "\n",
      "PREMIUM PLAN (ARPU €8.5/mo, separate retention curve):\n",
      "  Pre-fix  (M6 ret 55%):  €62.73\n",
      "  Post-fix (M6 ret 60%):  €67.32\n",
      "  Improvement:                 +€4.59 (+7%)\n",
      "\n",
      "PREMIUM vs FREE (post-fix):\n",
      "  Premium LTV is 4.3× higher than Free\n",
      "  Decomposition: ARPU ratio 2.66× × retention-sum ratio 1.62× = 4.3×\n",
      "  → The gap reflects BOTH higher ARPU AND higher retention (the prior\n",
      "     version reused the Free curve for Premium, collapsing it to ARPU only).\n",
      "  → Monetization lever: convert free users to premium\n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "FLEET-LEVEL BUSINESS IMPACT\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "Assumptions:\n",
      "  • Monthly new activated users: 5,000\n",
      "  • Current premium plan share: 18%\n",
      "  • Time horizon: 12 months per cohort\n",
      "\n",
      "12-MONTH CUMULATIVE REVENUE per monthly cohort:\n",
      "  Pre-fix scenario:  €   105,788\n",
      "  Post-fix scenario: €   124,745\n",
      "  Incremental revenue (from KYC fix): €    18,957\n",
      "\n",
      "ANNUALIZED INCREMENTAL REVENUE:\n",
      "  €227,479/year from retention improvement alone\n",
      "  (Steady-state assumption: 12 cohorts/yr each at the per-cohort figure;\n",
      "   on top of the activation lift from Project 2.)\n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "COHORT SUMMARY: Sizes & Retention Trends\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "Cohort       Size       M1 Ret%    M3 Ret%    M6 Ret%    Post-fix    \n",
      "----------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "2024-01      5,026      49.9%      32.9%      21.3%      No          \n",
      "2024-02      4,859      52.9%      31.7%      20.9%      No          \n",
      "2024-03      4,670      52.7%      31.9%      20.0%      No          \n",
      "2024-04      5,253      53.5%      29.7%      21.4%      No          \n",
      "2024-05      5,284      51.4%      29.7%      19.3%      No          \n",
      "2024-06      5,063      51.3%      32.7%      18.7%      No          \n",
      "2024-07      5,266      51.4%      29.7%      18.6%      No          \n",
      "2024-08      5,295      51.1%      27.6%      19.0%      No          \n",
      "2024-09      5,093      63.6%      40.3%      31.9%      Yes ✅       \n",
      "2024-10      4,629      67.2%      39.0%      33.7%      Yes ✅       \n",
      "2024-11      4,147      61.3%      40.6%      31.6%      Yes ✅       \n",
      "2024-12      5,707      62.4%      39.8%      31.3%      Yes ✅       \n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "STATISTICAL TEST: M3 Retention — Post-fix vs Pre-fix Cohorts\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "Pre-fix M3 retention (mean):  30.7%  (8 cohorts)\n",
      "Post-fix M3 retention (mean): 39.9%  (4 cohorts)\n",
      "\n",
      "Absolute difference: +9.2 percentage points\n",
      "Welch t-statistic: 12.344\n",
      "P-value:           0.0000\n",
      "Cohen's d:         5.77  (large effect)\n",
      "Significance level (α): 0.05\n",
      "\n",
      "⚠️  Note: n is small (8+4 cohorts) — low power;\n",
      "   treat the p-value as directional, not definitive.\n",
      "\n",
      "✅ RESULT: Statistically significant improvement (p < 0.05)\n",
      "   Post-fix cohorts have significantly higher M3 retention.\n",
      "\n",
      "======================================================================\n",
      "BOOTSTRAP CONFIDENCE INTERVALS (M1 / M3 / M6)\n",
